{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["In the wilderness of Sinai, in the tent of meeting, on the second month — all the divine speeches that were given in the first year, before the Mishkan was set up, have בהר סיני written in them; but from when the Mishkan was set up on the first of the month in the second year, it does not say בהר סיני, but rather: במדבר סיני באהל מועד. And thus it is demonstrated before us, as it is written: ואלה תולדות אהרן ומשה ביום דבר ה׳ את משה בהר סיני — before the Mishkan was set up, at that time the descendants of Aharon were four: ואלה שמות בני אהרן נדב ואביהוא ואלעזר ואיתמר. But in the end, in the second year when the Mishkan was set up, they were only two, for in the end, when the Mishkan was set up in the second year, it is stated: וימת נדב ואביהוא לפני ה׳ במדבר סיני. In the wilderness of Sinai they were four, and in the end two, for on the very day that the tent of meeting was set up, Nadav and Avihu died."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:43.352223817Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}